# Slice 292 observation: the value `call: s D` leaves in D's field, as the exit code (100 + D\a; 120 + seen when s did not run).
D:
    int: a 0
end: D
int: seen 0
fn: read_seen () int
    return: node\seen
end: read_seen
sub: s ()
    int: a 5
    a: a + 1
    node\seen: 1
end: s
call: s D
int: code 100 + D\a
if: read_seen() != 1
    code: 120 + read_seen()
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
